#ASSERT `the total CPF contribution` 72 3000 2026 EQUALS 375

#ASSERT `the employee's CPF share` 55 4000 2026 EQUALS 800
#ASSERT `the employee's CPF share` 58 4000 2026 EQUALS 720
#ASSERT `the employee's CPF share` 62 3000 2026 EQUALS 375
#ASSERT `the employee's CPF share` 68 3000 2026 EQUALS 225
#ASSERT `the employee's CPF share` 72 3000 2026 EQUALS 150

