§ `First Schedule para 7(b), (c) -- rounding`

-- 37% of 1,350 = 499.50 -> 500 (50 cents counts as a dollar); 37% of 1,001 = 370.37 -> 370; employee share 200.20 -> 200;
-- at $520: 17% of 520 + 0.6 x 20 = 100.40 -> 100, employee 12.
#ASSERT `the total CPF contribution` 23 1350 2026 EQUALS 500
#ASSERT `the total CPF contribution` 23 1001 2026 EQUALS 370
#ASSERT `the total CPF contribution` 23 520 2026 EQUALS 100

#ASSERT `the employee's CPF share` 23 1001 2026 EQUALS 200
#ASSERT `the employee's CPF share` 23 520 2026 EQUALS 12

§ `REQ-0012 (cradle-to-grave-simone e088) -- ss 24(3A), 25(5)`

-- A member dies with a will leaving everything to his wife and a nomination in her favour. The CPF moneys pass under
-- the nomination on trust and are not part of the estate (s 24(3A)).
#ASSERT NOT `CPF moneys paid on death form part of the member's estate` 

#ASSERT NOT `CPF moneys paid on death are subject to the member's debts` 

#ASSERT `the nomination is in force at death` TRUE FALSE FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `the nomination is in force at death` TRUE TRUE FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `the nomination is in force at death` TRUE FALSE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `the nomination is in force at death` FALSE FALSE FALSE

#ASSERT `who the CPF moneys are held on trust for` TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS "the nominee"
#ASSERT `who the CPF moneys are held on trust for` TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS "the persons entitled through the Public Trustee under section 25A"
#ASSERT `who the CPF moneys are held on trust for` FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS "the persons entitled through the Public Trustee under section 25A"

